- Track B also fails for the paper’s \(G_k-e\) construction: both the mechanical and “compact” routes are essentially the same linear chain propagation, measured at about 0.003 seconds for \(k=120\). There is no meaningful compression gap.

The complete, quantified decision is in [REJECTED.md](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/1903.12570/REJECTED.md). It cites the exact definitions, easy regimes, relevant theorems, measured costs, and the structure-aware guess density. See also the [full arXiv paper](https://arxiv.org/html/1903.12570v2).
